version: 2.0.0
purpose: CLI-side university core - types and storage
description: >
  Core types and storage operations for per-project university content.
  Mirrors MCP-side university-loader.ts for CLI command usage.
  v6.6.5: ported the v6.6.4 pack-selector loader contract — storage CRUD/search
  accept an optional packRoot. resolveContentBase/loadPackIndex use the
  contains-content dual-base probe (content/ → src/content/). The no-packRoot
  path stays byte-identical (project pack, no pack_id stamping).

components:
  UniversityStorage:
    description: >
      CRUD operations for notes, quizzes, paths, diplomas. v6.6.5 adds optional
      packRoot threading (loadPackIndex, searchContent, loadNote/Quiz/Path,
      saveNote/Quiz) + searchContentWithMeta total counts. Write-path stamps
      pack_id (raw-YAML manifest id) ONLY when packRoot is explicitly passed.
    type: storage
    tags: [university, storage, pack, v6.6.5]
